{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05248","headline":"奉和幸白鹿观应制 · 武平一","name":"奉和幸白鹿观应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉府凌三曜，金坛驻六龙。\n彩旒悬倒景，羽盖偃乔松。\n玄圃灵芝秀，华池瑞液浓。\n谬因沾舜渥，长愿奉尧封。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武平一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}